ほら Catch You Catch You Catch Me Catch Me 待って
Look, Catch You, Catch You, Catch Me, Catch Me, wait!

177
00:25:11,050 --> 00:25:14,600
こっちをむいて スキだといって
Turn towards me, say you love me!

178
00:25:14,600 --> 00:25:17,600
そう Nice to Meet You Good to See You きっと
Yes, Nice to Meet You, Good to See You, surely.

179
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:20,800
私の想い あなたのハートに
My feelings, into your heart,

180
00:25:20,800 --> 00:25:24,300
飛んで 飛んで 飛んでいけ 迷わない
Fly, fly, fly away, without hesitation!

181
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:26,800
たまにね なくなっちゃう 身体のバッテリー
