182
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:28,300
あなたの笑顔で いつも充電満タン
but with your smile, I'm always fully charged!

183
00:25:28,300 --> 00:25:29,900
パワー爆発しちゃえ
Power explodes!

184
00:25:29,900 --> 00:25:32,700
お願い お願い まずは お友達から
Please, please, let's start as friends first!

185
00:25:32,700 --> 00:25:35,650
笑って 見つめて 楽しい毎日日にしたい
Laugh, gaze at each other, I want to make every day fun!

186
00:25:35,650 --> 00:25:38,550
ほら Catch You Catch You Catch Me Catch Me ゼッタイ
Look, Catch You, Catch You, Catch Me, Catch Me, absolutely!

187
00:25:38,550 --> 00:25:42,100
運命だって お似合いだって
It's fate, it suits us!

188
00:25:42,100 --> 00:25:45,050
そう Nice to Meet You Good to See You きっと
Yes, Nice to Meet You, Good to See You, surely.

189
00:25:45,050 --> 00:25:48,600
誰にも負けない あなたに世界で
I won't lose to anyone, to you in the world!

190
