こっちをむいて スキだといって
Turn towards me, say you love me!

193
00:26:06,950 --> 00:26:10,250
そう Nice to Meet You Good to See You きっと
Yes, Nice to Meet You, Good to See You, surely.

194
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:13,750
私の想い あなたのハートに
My feelings, into your heart,

195
00:26:13,750 --> 00:26:16,350
飛んで 飛んで 飛んでいけ 迷わない
fly, fly, fly away, without hesitation!

196
